      "sc:description": "AQuA2-Cloud is a portable, cloud-native web platform designed for performing advanced, multi-user spatiotemporal activity quantification from fluorescence bioimaging datasets. It improves upon existing tools by reducing software licensing requirements and centralizing analysis workflows.",
